<title>LATVIA: BLUE CHIPS STABLE TO HIGHER, UNIBANKA LEADS.</title>
<headline>BLUE CHIPS STABLE TO HIGHER, UNIBANKA LEADS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
